24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3IcHCF0oCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3 到 4 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3YcHCGAoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3IcHCF8oDA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車不方便",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3YcHCGIoAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3IcHCGEoDQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_LOT"],"付費停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3YcHCGQoAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3IcHCGMoDg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3YcHCGYoAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjg24mh-NmWAxUGklYBHf52NxAQ3IcHCGUoDw",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這家店每次經過生意都蠻好的.再次經過剛好午餐時間，就來個雞湯麵當午餐吧！可能期待值高所以標準也拉高.點了松露牛肝菌雞湯麵.裡面有雞腿肉、雞胸肉、酒肉丸跟雞胗，因為我不敢吃雞胗所以不加.雞腿肉偏乾、雞胸肉軟嫩、雞丸子風味最有層次.麵選正常，軟硬度ok，但麵沒煮均勻，吃到一坨未煮開的麵條❌’湯聞起來香中飄著松露味.但湯很鹹反而把松露味跟牛肝菌壓過去.整體表現正常不帶特色.（甜點是贈送的喔）",null,[0,194]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/